roduct priorities.",{"children":["— ","Reshaped the design function during a company turnaround and brought the teams together around shared product priorities."]}],["$","li","Led customer-journey research using analytics, interviews, and usability tests. Presented the findings to leadership and helped refocus the backlog on the biggest user pain points.",{"children":["— ","Led customer-journey research using analytics, interviews, and usability tests. Presented the findings to leadership and helped refocus the backlog on the biggest user pain points."]}],["$","li","Developed Marketplace Vision 2027 and secured leadership buy-in, giving the buyer, seller, and logistics teams a shared direction.",{"children":["— ","Developed Marketplace Vision 2027 and secured leadership buy-in, giving the buyer, seller, and logistics teams a shared direction."]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"_overviewGroup_hjgy5_55","data-m10-reveal":true,"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"_label_hjgy5_57","children":"Project results"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"_resultNote_bfc6d_23","children":"I’d be happy to share selected results and discuss the impact of this work in a conversation."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"_stickerColumn_bfc6d_15","children":["$","$Ld",null,{"src":"/projects/birmarket/sticker.png","alt":"Birmarket is an Azerbaijani marketplace with around 1.5M monthly active users","width":531,"height":514,"sizes":"(max-width: 1079px) 260px, 320px"}]}]]}]]}]}],["$","footer",null,{"className":"_footer_hjgy5_91","children":"© Alexander Lozhkin"}]]}]]}]
